{"ticker":"WRB","updated":"2026-10-24T00:28:19Z","profile":{"longName":"W. R. Berkley Corporation","shortName":"W.R. Berkley Corporation","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Insurance - Property & Casualty","country":"United States","website":"https://www.berkley.com","fullTimeEmployees":8804,"marketCap":27222114304,"trailingPE":15.503172,"forwardPE":15.073714,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.8310827,"pegRatio":4.97,"targetMeanPrice":69.23529,"targetHighPrice":83.0,"targetLowPrice":51.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":17,"recommendationKey":"hold","revenueGrowth":-0.008,"earningsGrowth":-0.109,"grossMargins":0.43605,"operatingMargins":0.1607,"profitMargins":0.12531,"totalRevenue":14866676736,"beta":0.271,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":78.96,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":62.87,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.53},"summary":"W. R. Berkley Corporation, an insurance holding company, operates as a commercial line writer worldwide. The company operates through Insurance and Reinsurance & Monoline Excess segments. The Insurance segment underwrites commercial insurance business, including excess and surplus lines, admitted lines, and specialty personal lines. This segment also provides accident and health insurance and reinsurance products; insurance for commercial risks; casualty and specialty environmental products; insurance coverages for fine arts and jewelry exposures; excess liability and inland marine coverage for small to medium-sized insureds; and commercial general liability, umbrella, professional liability, directors and officers, commercial property, and surety products, as well as products for technology, and life sciences and travel industries. In addition, it offers cyber risk solutions; crime and fidelity insurance products; medical professional coverages; workers' compensation insurance products; management liability and general insurance products; personal lines insurance solutions, including home, condo/co-op, auto, fine arts and collectibles, liability, collector vehicle, and recreational marine; law enforcement, public officials and educator's legal, and employment practices liability, as well as incidental medical, property, and crime insurance products; at-risk and alternative ris","summary_zh":"W. R. Berkley Corporation 是一家保險控股公司，在全球從事商業廣告撰稿業務。該公司透過保險、再保險和單險超額業務部門營運。保險部門承保商業保險業務，包括超額和盈餘險種、進入險種和特殊個人險種。該部門還提供意外和健康保險以及再保險產品；商業風險保險；傷亡和特種環境產品；美術和珠寶風險保險；中小型被保險人的超額責任和內陸海上保險；商業一般責任、保護傘、專業責任、董事和高級職員、商業財產和擔保產品，以及技術、生命科學和旅遊業的產品。此外，它還提供網路風險解決方案；犯罪和忠誠保險產品；醫療專業保險；工傷賠償保險產品；管理責任和一般保險產品；個人險種保險解決方案，包括房屋、公寓/合作公寓、汽車、美術和收藏品、責任、收藏車輛和休閒船舶；執法、公職人員和教育者的法律和就業實踐","sector_zh":"金融服務","industry_zh":"保險 - 財產與意外傷害","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":71.87,"h":72.06,"l":71.09,"c":71.13,"v":1283500},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":71.1,"h":71.33,"l":70.82,"c":71.05,"v":1854500},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":71.21,"h":71.98,"l":70.99,"c":71.67,"v":1133300},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":71.33,"h":71.53,"l":70.91,"c":71.24,"v":1260600},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":71.4,"h":71.86,"l":71.22,"c":71.69,"v":1383900},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":71.77,"h":72.22,"l":71.22,"c":71.98,"v":1521700},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":71.65,"h":72.38,"l":71.4,"c":72.28,"v":1320400},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":72.81,"h":73.35,"l":72.52,"c":72.92,"v":1606100},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":72.83,"h":73.02,"l":71.65,"c":71.96,"v":1242700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":71.85,"h":72.58,"l":71.09,"c":72.41,"v":1507300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":72.27,"h":72.71,"l":72.03,"c":72.28,"v":1445800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":71.97,"h":72.26,"l":71.55,"c":72.15,"v":1525400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":72.21,"h":73.88,"l":71.99,"c":73.78,"v":1644400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":73.57,"h":74.24,"l":73.23,"c":73.82,"v":1496600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":73.67,"h":74.04,"l":72.73,"c":72.79,"v":1561300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":72.56,"h":72.56,"l":70.43,"c":71.42,"v":3552400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":71.6,"h":73.32,"l":71.42,"c":73.11,"v":1815800},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":72.71,"h":73.3,"l":72.09,"c":73.1,"v":2548200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":73.31,"h":73.66,"l":72.99,"c":7